{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GNaigxsHuD1794300901.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>考評局出版《試題專輯》，總結今年文憑試考生表現。中文科閱讀卷，考生表現略遜去年，指定篇章部分漏答嚴重。英文科，部分能力較弱考生在口試中犯下大量文法錯誤，建議考生應努力在日常生活嘗試用英語交談。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205515-%E8%80%83%E8%A9%95%E5%B1%80%E7%B8%BD%E7%B5%90%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E6%96%87%E6%86%91%E8%A9%A6%E8%80%83%E7%94%9F%E8%A1%A8%E7%8F%BE%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%E7%A7%91%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80%E5%8D%B7%E8%80%83%E7%94%9F%E8%A1%A8%E7%8F%BE%E7%95%A5%E9%81%9C%E5%8E%BB%E5%B9%B4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>考評局總結今年文憑試考生表現　中文科閱讀卷考生表現略遜去年</strong></a></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案，一名陪審員以健康理由退出，法官指會以8人陪審團繼續審訊。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205524-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%80%E5%90%8D%E9%99%AA%E5%AF%A9%E5%93%A1%E4%BB%A5%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E4%BB%A58%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%AA%E5%AF%A9%E5%9C%98%E7%B9%BC%E7%BA%8C%E5%AF%A9%E8%A8%8A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜一名陪審員以健康理由退出　以8人陪審團繼續審訊</strong></a></p><p></p><p>有22年歷史的「幻彩詠香江」下周三舉行最後一場。旅發局主席林建岳表示，當晚會加入煙火元素，明年會陸續推出其他光影項目。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205544-%E5%B9%BB%E5%BD%A9%E8%A9%A0%E9%A6%99%E6%B1%9F%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%89%E5%91%8A%E5%88%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%87%BA%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E7%85%99%E7%81%AB%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E6%98%8E%E5%B9%B4%E9%99%B8%E7%BA%8C%E6%8E%A8%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%85%89%E5%BD%B1%E9%A0%85%E7%9B%AE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>「幻彩詠香江」下周三告別演出加入煙火元素　明年陸續推其他光影項目</strong></a></p><p></p><p>天文台清晨錄得最低氣溫17.5度，是入秋以來最低紀錄。不少上班上學的人，都換上長袖衫、厚外套，部分人亦戴上頸巾。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205514-%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%A3%E5%A4%A9%E6%96%87%E5%8F%B0%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8%E9%8C%84%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E%E6%B0%A3%E6%BA%AB175%E5%BA%A6%E6%96%99%E5%91%A8%E5%9B%9B%E6%B0%A3%E6%BA%AB%E5%9B%9E%E5%8D%87\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>天氣｜天文台清晨錄最低氣溫17.5度　料周四氣溫回升</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205503-%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%A3%E5%8B%95%E6%85%8B%E5%9C%96%E6%B0%A3%E6%BA%AB%E5%A6%82%E9%81%8E%E5%B1%B1%E8%BB%8A%E5%85%88%E8%B7%8C%E5%BE%8C%E5%8D%87%E6%9C%AA%E5%88%B0%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%AB%E6%88%96%E5%B7%B2%E5%9B%9E%E6%9A%96%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E7%89%87%E6%A9%99%E7%B4%85%E9%99%84%E4%B9%9D%E5%A4%A9%E9%A0%90%E5%A0%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>天氣動態圖｜氣溫如過山車先跌後升？未到周末或已回暖　地圖一片橙紅｜附九天預報</strong></a></p><p></p><p>一名小巴司機早上載客時懷疑毒後駕駛被警方拘捕。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205527-%E5%B0%8F%E5%B7%B4%E5%8F%B8%E6%A9%9F%E8%BC%89%E8%91%97%E4%B9%98%E5%AE%A2%E6%99%82%E7%96%91%E6%AF%92%E5%BE%8C%E9%A7%95%E9%A7%9B%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%89%E6%8F%90%E5%A0%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>小巴司機載著乘客時疑毒後駕駛被捕　周三提堂</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.586233+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":482,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:28:23.000193+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:13.657418+00:00","content_hash":"252f0ae29cb86553e940f277920ced2e3c921354e862f17d0c6828136174718a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.586233+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}